{"text":"Come over if you don’t want to talk.","feeling":"Love","emoji":"🤍","bg":["#c7b9d9","#a99bc5"],"fg":"#241b35"}
{"text":"Dinner’s on me if you come tonight.","feeling":"Happy","emoji":"🍽️","bg":["#f3c27b","#e99a62"],"fg":"#3a1d08"}
{"text":"Can you bring my spare top?","feeling":"Neutral","emoji":"👕","bg":["#b8c6ce","#91a8b5"],"fg":"#17252d"}
{"text":"Wait, was the assignment due today?","feeling":"Afraid","emoji":"😰","bg":["#f0b36e","#df7d68"],"fg":"#35140e"}
{"text":"I knocked softly, but heard nothing.","feeling":"Sad","emoji":"🚪","bg":["#596579","#3f4a61"],"fg":"#f5ead2"}
{"text":"Buzzing to see those taps finally fitted!","feeling":"Happy","emoji":"🤩","bg":["#b8e8ff","#6fc1d9"],"fg":"#082b3a"}
{"text":"Your socks are under the chair.","feeling":"Neutral","emoji":"🧦","bg":["#e5e8ed","#b9c2cc"],"fg":"#17202a"}
{"text":"Practice was brutal, but the sunset helped.","feeling":"Happy","emoji":"🌅","bg":["#f6b36b","#d97865"],"fg":"#351b27"}
{"text":"Just found out attendance counts","feeling":"Afraid","emoji":"😬","bg":["#f4df91","#d5b85c"],"fg":"#302600"}
{"text":"Not proud of that pace, still finished","feeling":"Happy","emoji":"😮‍💨","bg":["#b9d7c5","#83ad98"],"fg":"#10281d"}
{"text":"Not thrilled that my tank got nerfed again.","feeling":"Angry","emoji":"😤","bg":["#e6a39a","#c96f6a"],"fg":"#35100e"}
{"text":"Your turn to panic","feeling":"Happy","emoji":"😈","bg":["#d9b4ed","#a87bc7"],"fg":"#24102f"}
