{"text":"This conversation is over. Leave.","feeling":"Angry","emoji":"🚪","bg":["#7a1f2b","#b33a3a"],"fg":"#ffffff"}
{"text":"Nothing is loud in my head anymore","feeling":"Happy","emoji":"😌","bg":["#b9dce8","#8fb9c8"],"fg":"#12303a"}
{"text":"This timber delivery is absolutely spot on.","feeling":"Happy","emoji":"✅","bg":["#dbe9c4","#a9c98d"],"fg":"#1d321b"}
{"text":"I'm about to lose it with you.","feeling":"Angry","emoji":"😡","bg":["#8f2020","#c44532"],"fg":"#ffffff"}
{"text":"News update: I found my glasses","feeling":"Happy","emoji":"🤓","bg":["#ffe79b","#f4bd70"],"fg":"#39240b"}
{"text":"I wasn't worried till the ceiling dripped","feeling":"Afraid","emoji":"😰","bg":["#d7e1e5","#aebdc5"],"fg":"#1c2b32"}
{"text":"I am sick of your constant excuses.","feeling":"Angry","emoji":"🙄","bg":["#9e3c27","#d86635"],"fg":"#ffffff"}
{"text":"The Wi-Fi died during my meeting.","feeling":"Angry","emoji":"😤","bg":["#536da8","#394f86"],"fg":"#ffffff"}
{"text":"The office plants look neglected too.","feeling":"Sad","emoji":"😕","bg":["#b8c9b0","#8fa58c"],"fg":"#18251b"}
{"text":"She’s smiling today, which feels like a win","feeling":"Happy","emoji":"😊","bg":["#ffe39a","#ffc56d"],"fg":"#422500"}
{"text":"I keep expecting you to come back","feeling":"Sad","emoji":"💭","bg":["#b8c4df","#8e9fc5"],"fg":"#18233c"}
{"text":"I left the spare key in the blue pot.","feeling":"Neutral","emoji":"🔑","bg":["#b8d8e8","#8fbfd4"],"fg":"#102531"}
{"text":"Weights at 6, then lecture at 8. Bad planning.","feeling":"Angry","emoji":"😩","bg":["#e7b7a5","#d89488"],"fg":"#351713"}
{"text":"Did you sleep? Honest answer, please.","feeling":"Afraid","emoji":"😟","bg":["#b9cee0","#91b3ce"],"fg":"#142536"}
