{"text":"I’m calling that a personal best","feeling":"Happy","emoji":"🏆","bg":["#ffe08a","#f6b45b"],"fg":"#422500"}
{"text":"Wasn't excited tbh, but the edits work.","feeling":"Happy","emoji":"🙂","bg":["#d5dce8","#c5c2df"],"fg":"#252b45"}
{"text":"Your hoodie is still on my chair.","feeling":"Love","emoji":"🥰","bg":["#ffe1b8","#e8b6b9"],"fg":"#4a2026"}
