{"text":"Hold up, the bill is zero?","feeling":"Happy","emoji":"😮","bg":["#ffe08a","#ffb35c"],"fg":"#3a2100"}
{"text":"What? You finished first?","feeling":"Happy","emoji":"🏆","bg":["#ffe69a","#ffc766"],"fg":"#3a2500"}
{"text":"Wait, the train is here already?","feeling":"Happy","emoji":"🚆","bg":["#b9e8ff","#79c7ed"],"fg":"#102d45"}
{"text":"Bro, that statue just blinked!","feeling":"Afraid","emoji":"😱","bg":["#6b6e9e","#3d416f"],"fg":"#ffffff"}
{"text":"No way, it's my favorite song!","feeling":"Happy","emoji":"🎶","bg":["#ffd1e8","#f39ac5"],"fg":"#45152f"}
{"text":"You got tickets for tomorrow?","feeling":"Happy","emoji":"🎟️","bg":["#b9f0d0","#72d6a7"],"fg":"#103b2b"}
{"text":"Seriously, the shop is closed?","feeling":"Sad","emoji":"😞","bg":["#b7c2d1","#8796aa"],"fg":"#172333"}
{"text":"What do you mean, he quit?","feeling":"Sad","emoji":"💔","bg":["#c5b5c8","#9e879f"],"fg":"#2e1b2b"}
{"text":"Hold on, that's not your house?","feeling":"Afraid","emoji":"🏠","bg":["#d7d1e8","#aaa0c8"],"fg":"#211b38"}
{"text":"Wait, the password worked?","feeling":"Happy","emoji":"🔓","bg":["#c9f2c3","#8bd98d"],"fg":"#173b1c"}
{"text":"No way, you met my idol!","feeling":"Surprised","emoji":"🤩","bg":["#ffd166","#f4a261"],"fg":"#3a1d00"}
{"text":"You brought the exact one?","feeling":"Surprised","emoji":"😲","bg":["#9ad9ff","#72b7e6"],"fg":"#102a43"}
{"text":"Bro, you made it to the finals?","feeling":"Surprised","emoji":"😲","bg":["#c4b5fd","#8b7bd8"],"fg":"#211744"}
{"text":"Seriously, the room changed?","feeling":"Surprised","emoji":"😳","bg":["#f9c6d3","#e99aaa"],"fg":"#4a1625"}
{"text":"Wait, those are our names?","feeling":"Surprised","emoji":"😯","bg":["#a8e6cf","#6fc7b0"],"fg":"#10352d"}
{"text":"No way, you were there too?","feeling":"Surprised","emoji":"😮","bg":["#ffd6a5","#ffad80"],"fg":"#4a2108"}
{"text":"I nearly gagged at the state of that toilet.","feeling":"Disgusted","emoji":"🤮","bg":["#c6d4a5","#91aa70"],"fg":"#202b16"}
{"text":"Who leaves chewing gum under a bus seat?","feeling":"Disgusted","emoji":"😒","bg":["#c7c2b2","#9e9889"],"fg":"#29251d"}
{"text":"That sandwich smelled like a dead sock.","feeling":"Disgusted","emoji":"🤢","bg":["#b8b27a","#8f8a58"],"fg":"#241f14"}
{"text":"I won't touch that fridge shelf with gloves on.","feeling":"Disgusted","emoji":"🧤","bg":["#a8b99a","#78906f"],"fg":"#172016"}
{"text":"The milk had lumps. I felt sick just seeing it.","feeling":"Disgusted","emoji":"🤮","bg":["#d4c98c","#aaa45e"],"fg":"#27220f"}
