{"text":"I nearly spat out the tea.","feeling":"Disgusted","emoji":"🤮","bg":["#c2b98d","#9f9568"],"fg":"#282015"}
{"text":"That plate was covered in grime.","feeling":"Disgusted","emoji":"🧽","bg":["#b8b39a","#827d68"],"fg":"#1b1b16"}
{"text":"What a disgusting way to treat food.","feeling":"Disgusted","emoji":"🤢","bg":["#d2a86e","#a87852"],"fg":"#24160f"}
