{"text":"What, this pipe carries rainwater?","feeling":"Surprised","emoji":"🌧️","bg":["#b9d9e8","#789bb5"],"fg":"#102b3d"}
{"text":"No way, that's a Victorian boiler!","feeling":"Surprised","emoji":"😲","bg":["#d6b58a","#a87952"],"fg":"#26170f"}
{"text":"Hang on, the tap's connected to nothing!","feeling":"Surprised","emoji":"🤨","bg":["#c9d7dc","#91aab2"],"fg":"#17282d"}
{"text":"Wow, the wall moved when I touched it!","feeling":"Surprised","emoji":"😮","bg":["#f2c879","#d99557"],"fg":"#38200d"}
{"text":"Cor, that's a nest in the flue!","feeling":"Surprised","emoji":"🪺","bg":["#c4b18a","#96805d"],"fg":"#241d12"}
