{"text":"Good grief, the fuse is wrapped in foil!","feeling":"Afraid","emoji":"⚠️","bg":["#e2c56d","#c9964e"],"fg":"#302008"}
{"text":"You're joking, there's gas in this pipe!","feeling":"Afraid","emoji":"😨","bg":["#d58b70","#a9534e"],"fg":"#2b1114"}
{"text":"Whoa, the gutter's growing grass!","feeling":"Surprised","emoji":"🌱","bg":["#b8c978","#7fa05b"],"fg":"#172512"}
{"text":"Blimey, this brickwork is upside down!","feeling":"Surprised","emoji":"🙃","bg":["#d98b62","#b9684f"],"fg":"#24150f"}
{"text":"What? There's a cellar under here!","feeling":"Surprised","emoji":"😲","bg":["#9aafbd","#6f8493"],"fg":"#111a20"}
