{"text":"Hang on, the window's bricked from outside!","feeling":"Surprised","emoji":"😧","bg":["#b8c6d1","#7f929f"],"fg":"#17232b"}
{"text":"Wow, the drain cover is indoors!","feeling":"Surprised","emoji":"😮","bg":["#b9d8d0","#76aaa0"],"fg":"#102c2a"}
{"text":"Crikey, there's a socket in the shower!","feeling":"Afraid","emoji":"⚡","bg":["#d7c7e8","#a895c4"],"fg":"#21152d"}
{"text":"Wait, this door is load-bearing!","feeling":"Afraid","emoji":"😰","bg":["#d8b08c","#b87962"],"fg":"#30150f"}
