{"text":"Well, that's not what I expected at all!","feeling":"Surprised","emoji":"😲","bg":["#ffe2b8","#f6b27d"],"fg":"#3b2114"}
{"text":"The postman brought me a birthday cake!","feeling":"Happy","emoji":"🎂","bg":["#ffe98a","#ffb36b"],"fg":"#42200e"}
