{"text":"Goodness, the cat opened the cupboard!","feeling":"Surprised","emoji":"🐈","bg":["#eadcff","#cbb8e8"],"fg":"#2c1e45"}
{"text":"I just found twenty pounds in my old coat!","feeling":"Happy","emoji":"💷","bg":["#ffe18a","#b9d98b"],"fg":"#26300f"}
{"text":"At my age, I never thought I'd see snow in June!","feeling":"Surprised","emoji":"❄️","bg":["#e3f5ff","#b8dced"],"fg":"#173044"}
