{"text":"They cancelled bingo? On a Thursday?","feeling":"Angry","emoji":"😠","bg":["#e9a39b","#d47770"],"fg":"#421310"}
{"text":"The doctor is younger than my grandson!","feeling":"Surprised","emoji":"😲","bg":["#c8d9e8","#a7bfd4"],"fg":"#172b3d"}
