{"text":"The tomatoes grew overnight!","feeling":"Surprised","emoji":"🍅","bg":["#f5b39c","#e98976"],"fg":"#451711"}
{"text":"Arthur has finally learned to text!","feeling":"Happy","emoji":"📱","bg":["#c5e6b5","#9dce91"],"fg":"#1c3517"}
{"text":"The shop still has my favourite biscuits!","feeling":"Happy","emoji":"😋","bg":["#f8d98b","#eeb86f"],"fg":"#3a2108"}
{"text":"I looked up, and the moon was enormous!","feeling":"Surprised","emoji":"🌕","bg":["#5f6fa3","#3f4f82"],"fg":"#fff4c2"}
