{"text":"The bakery had my loaf ready!","feeling":"Happy","emoji":"🍞","bg":["#f2c487","#dc9b58"],"fg":"#3d210d"}
{"text":"My old friend called from Australia!","feeling":"Love","emoji":"📞","bg":["#b9c8f2","#879be0"],"fg":"#17234d"}
{"text":"The rain came after I watered everything!","feeling":"Happy","emoji":"🌧️","bg":["#9fc9d6","#6fa6bc"],"fg":"#102b35"}
{"text":"I found a pound in the trolley!","feeling":"Happy","emoji":"💷","bg":["#b9d99a","#83bd78"],"fg":"#193517"}
