{"text":"My plant has grown a new leaf!","feeling":"Happy","emoji":"🌱","bg":["#d9f5c5","#a8d98b"],"fg":"#173b19"}
{"text":"The museum is free for pensioners today!","feeling":"Happy","emoji":"🎟️","bg":["#ffe7b3","#ffd080"],"fg":"#4a2900"}
{"text":"I got served before my number was called!","feeling":"Surprised","emoji":"😲","bg":["#c9edff","#8fd3f4"],"fg":"#102d40"}
{"text":"The grandchildren know how to darn socks!","feeling":"Happy","emoji":"🧵","bg":["#f8d7c4","#eeb39a"],"fg":"#432015"}
{"text":"The village fete has a disco?","feeling":"Surprised","emoji":"🪩","bg":["#d8d0ff","#aaa0e8"],"fg":"#21184d"}
{"text":"My umbrella stayed dry all afternoon!","feeling":"Happy","emoji":"☂️","bg":["#d5efff","#a6d8ed"],"fg":"#123248"}
{"text":"The library found the book I wanted!","feeling":"Happy","emoji":"📚","bg":["#f6dfb5","#e9c77d"],"fg":"#3e2908"}
{"text":"I looked in the mirror and saw no shaving foam!","feeling":"Happy","emoji":"😌","bg":["#d9f0e8","#b8d9d2"],"fg":"#17332f"}
