{"text":"I won at cards against Peter!","feeling":"Happy","emoji":"🃏","bg":["#e8c6d8","#d59fbb"],"fg":"#3b1730"}
{"text":"The boiler started on the first try!","feeling":"Happy","emoji":"🔥","bg":["#ffd1a3","#f2aa78"],"fg":"#3d1c0b"}
{"text":"The supermarket trolley has a working wheel!","feeling":"Happy","emoji":"🛒","bg":["#c9e8ed","#a7d3dc"],"fg":"#15343a"}
{"text":"My old school is now a hotel!","feeling":"Surprised","emoji":"🏨","bg":["#d8d0ee","#b9b0d8"],"fg":"#292343"}
{"text":"The doctor called me before I called him!","feeling":"Surprised","emoji":"📞","bg":["#c6e3f5","#a8c9e6"],"fg":"#142c42"}
{"text":"The cat brought home a fish bigger than itself!","feeling":"Surprised","emoji":"😲","bg":["#b8e6b8","#7fcf9a"],"fg":"#173b2a"}
{"text":"We have hot water before breakfast!","feeling":"Happy","emoji":"🙌","bg":["#ffe29a","#ffc477"],"fg":"#4a2600"}
{"text":"Wait, she smiled at me already?","feeling":"Surprised","emoji":"😳","bg":["#ffd1dc","#f5a9c0"],"fg":"#4a1727"}
{"text":"What, he rolled over already?","feeling":"Surprised","emoji":"🤸","bg":["#b9e8f5","#82cde0"],"fg":"#123442"}
{"text":"I did not expect that tiny sneeze.","feeling":"Surprised","emoji":"🤧","bg":["#e5d7f5","#c9b5e8"],"fg":"#2d1945"}
{"text":"She grabbed my finger on purpose!","feeling":"Love","emoji":"🥰","bg":["#ffd0d8","#f4a8b8"],"fg":"#4b1724"}
{"text":"Wait, newborns can make that face?","feeling":"Surprised","emoji":"😯","bg":["#ffe0b2","#ffc982"],"fg":"#4b290b"}
