{"text":"Why is she suddenly wearing size 3?","feeling":"Surprised","emoji":"😳","bg":["#d6d0ee","#bcb4dc"],"fg":"#282342"}
{"text":"I blinked, and he grew again.","feeling":"Surprised","emoji":"😲","bg":["#b9d8f2","#8faedb"],"fg":"#10243b"}
{"text":"She spit up on the ceiling. How?","feeling":"Disgusted","emoji":"🤢","bg":["#d8e8b0","#b7cf8a"],"fg":"#26351a"}
{"text":"He found his toes today. Already?","feeling":"Surprised","emoji":"🦶","bg":["#ffd98a","#f5b968"],"fg":"#422500"}
{"text":"Wait, that was a laugh, right?","feeling":"Happy","emoji":"😄","bg":["#ffe69a","#ffc477"],"fg":"#482900"}
{"text":"She has dimples! Since when?","feeling":"Love","emoji":"🥰","bg":["#f7c3c9","#ee9da9"],"fg":"#4a1725"}
