{"text":"I never knew you could swim!","feeling":"Surprised","emoji":"🏊","bg":["#b9eff3","#72c9dc"],"fg":"#07364a"}
{"text":"Good heavens, it's snowing!","feeling":"Surprised","emoji":"❄️","bg":["#e4f4ff","#c5d8f0"],"fg":"#1c3154"}
{"text":"You won the spelling bee? Truly?","feeling":"Surprised","emoji":"🏆","bg":["#ffe9a8","#bcd8f2"],"fg":"#182b4d"}
{"text":"My word, you're taller again!","feeling":"Surprised","emoji":"📏","bg":["#ead7f5","#d9b7df"],"fg":"#3d184c"}
{"text":"What a surprise to see you here!","feeling":"Surprised","emoji":"😲","bg":["#ffd1bd","#f5a98f"],"fg":"#4b1d1a"}
{"text":"Oh dear, the cat opened the door!","feeling":"Surprised","emoji":"🐈","bg":["#d9e8f5","#a9c7df"],"fg":"#182433"}
{"text":"You remembered my birthday?","feeling":"Happy","emoji":"🎂","bg":["#ffe6a3","#ffc4c4"],"fg":"#442018"}
{"text":"Well, fancy that!","feeling":"Surprised","emoji":"🤭","bg":["#e8d8f5","#c7b5e8"],"fg":"#24143d"}
{"text":"I can't believe the cake rose!","feeling":"Happy","emoji":"🍰","bg":["#ffe0a6","#f7b267"],"fg":"#3b1f08"}
{"text":"What? The baby has red hair?","feeling":"Surprised","emoji":"😮","bg":["#f7d6d0","#e9a6a6"],"fg":"#3a1717"}
{"text":"Goodness, that's quite a fish!","feeling":"Surprised","emoji":"🐟","bg":["#bfe8ed","#82cbd3"],"fg":"#10333a"}
{"text":"You built that all by yourself?","feeling":"Happy","emoji":"👏","bg":["#d8f0d0","#a9d8ae"],"fg":"#17351d"}
{"text":"Oh my, look at those flowers!","feeling":"Happy","emoji":"🌷","bg":["#f8d5e5","#eeb6d2"],"fg":"#42182f"}
{"text":"I never expected such a crowd!","feeling":"Surprised","emoji":"😲","bg":["#d8e1f5","#abbde3"],"fg":"#182442"}
{"text":"Well, bless me, it worked!","feeling":"Happy","emoji":"🙌","bg":["#ffe3a1","#ffc56e"],"fg":"#432400"}
{"text":"What a tremendous package!","feeling":"Happy","emoji":"📦","bg":["#ffd98a","#f6a65b"],"fg":"#3b1f0b"}
{"text":"You found my missing glasses?","feeling":"Happy","emoji":"🤓","bg":["#b8e6d1","#6fc3b2"],"fg":"#102d2a"}
{"text":"Good heavens, that's your new car?","feeling":"Surprised","emoji":"🚗","bg":["#b9d8f5","#729bd1"],"fg":"#10213b"}
{"text":"Oh my, the dog can sing!","feeling":"Surprised","emoji":"🐶","bg":["#f7d6a3","#e99a78"],"fg":"#3b1b16"}
{"text":"You finished already? Really?","feeling":"Surprised","emoji":"⏱️","bg":["#d8c7f2","#a898d8"],"fg":"#21183b"}
{"text":"My word, what a beautiful quilt!","feeling":"Happy","emoji":"🧵","bg":["#f5c6d6","#d995b5"],"fg":"#3b1728"}
{"text":"What? You met the queen?","feeling":"Surprised","emoji":"👑","bg":["#f7df8a","#e9b84f"],"fg":"#392706"}
{"text":"I never saw such a tall tree!","feeling":"Surprised","emoji":"🌳","bg":["#b9dfb0","#76b887"],"fg":"#12351d"}
{"text":"Goodness, the eggs hatched!","feeling":"Happy","emoji":"🐣","bg":["#ffe7a3","#f4bf72"],"fg":"#3a2508"}
{"text":"Well, I'll be darned!","feeling":"Surprised","emoji":"😲","bg":["#c9d7e8","#91accb"],"fg":"#172538"}
{"text":"Oh dear, the lights came back!","feeling":"Happy","emoji":"💡","bg":["#ffe9a8","#ffd27d"],"fg":"#332100"}
{"text":"You made this for me?","feeling":"Love","emoji":"🎁","bg":["#ffd6c9","#f5b6b8"],"fg":"#3b1720"}
{"text":"What a shock, seeing you here!","feeling":"Surprised","emoji":"😲","bg":["#c9d8f2","#aebfe3"],"fg":"#17233d"}
{"text":"Good heavens, it's your birthday!","feeling":"Surprised","emoji":"🎂","bg":["#ffe0a8","#ffc77d"],"fg":"#402000"}
{"text":"I can't believe that tiny seed!","feeling":"Surprised","emoji":"🌱","bg":["#d8edb5","#b9db9a"],"fg":"#183018"}
{"text":"Oh my, you've learned French!","feeling":"Surprised","emoji":"🇫🇷","bg":["#b9d9f2","#9fc4e5"],"fg":"#10243a"}
{"text":"You caught that enormous crab?","feeling":"Surprised","emoji":"🦀","bg":["#ffd0b0","#f3a98f"],"fg":"#421b12"}
{"text":"My word, the room looks splendid!","feeling":"Happy","emoji":"✨","bg":["#f8e4a8","#e9c978"],"fg":"#332500"}
{"text":"What? You got the job?","feeling":"Happy","emoji":"🎉","bg":["#c9edcf","#9edbb0"],"fg":"#12351c"}
{"text":"Goodness, the river froze!","feeling":"Surprised","emoji":"🥶","bg":["#c8e7f2","#a8d1e4"],"fg":"#102c3b"}
{"text":"I never thought he'd dance!","feeling":"Surprised","emoji":"😲","bg":["#d9b3ff","#8ec5fc"],"fg":"#24152f"}
{"text":"Well, fancy meeting you here!","feeling":"Happy","emoji":"😊","bg":["#ffd6a5","#ffadad"],"fg":"#3b1f12"}
{"text":"Oh my, that's a giant watermelon!","feeling":"Surprised","emoji":"🍉","bg":["#b7e778","#72c6a5"],"fg":"#17351f"}
{"text":"You really walked all that way?","feeling":"Surprised","emoji":"😮","bg":["#b8d8f8","#8fb8d9"],"fg":"#102a43"}
{"text":"What a marvelous surprise!","feeling":"Surprised","emoji":"🤩","bg":["#ffe08a","#ffb36b"],"fg":"#4a2500"}
{"text":"Good heavens, the bus is early!","feeling":"Surprised","emoji":"🚌","bg":["#9edbd3","#6fb3c8"],"fg":"#10343d"}
{"text":"I can't believe you remembered!","feeling":"Happy","emoji":"🥹","bg":["#f8c8dc","#f3a6c8"],"fg":"#42152d"}
{"text":"My word, that's a clever trick!","feeling":"Surprised","emoji":"✨","bg":["#c7b9f5","#9fa8da"],"fg":"#201642"}
{"text":"What? The old clock works?","feeling":"Surprised","emoji":"⏰","bg":["#b9c6d8","#8797b2"],"fg":"#172235"}
{"text":"Goodness, you've grown so much!","feeling":"Love","emoji":"🥰","bg":["#ffd1b8","#f5a3b7"],"fg":"#481b24"}
{"text":"Oh dear, the goat is indoors!","feeling":"Surprised","emoji":"🐐","bg":["#f6d365","#fda085"],"fg":"#3b1800"}
{"text":"You painted this lovely picture?","feeling":"Happy","emoji":"🎨","bg":["#fbc2eb","#a6c1ee"],"fg":"#241338"}
{"text":"I never expected so many birds!","feeling":"Surprised","emoji":"🐦","bg":["#89f7fe","#66a6ff"],"fg":"#08244a"}
{"text":"Well, look at you, all dressed up!","feeling":"Happy","emoji":"🤩","bg":["#ffd86f","#fc6262"],"fg":"#3a120d"}
{"text":"What a spectacular sunset!","feeling":"Happy","emoji":"🌅","bg":["#ffcf71","#ff8a5b"],"fg":"#401500"}
{"text":"Good heavens, that's your brother?","feeling":"Surprised","emoji":"😲","bg":["#c2e9fb","#81a4fd"],"fg":"#101d4a"}
{"text":"Oh my, the cake disappeared!","feeling":"Surprised","emoji":"🍰","bg":["#fbc2eb","#f6d365"],"fg":"#3b1b28"}
{"text":"You solved it already? My word!","feeling":"Happy","emoji":"🎉","bg":["#84fab0","#8fd3f4"],"fg":"#06352b"}
{"text":"I can't believe it's hailing!","feeling":"Surprised","emoji":"🌨️","bg":["#667eea","#3f5efb"],"fg":"#ffffff"}
{"text":"What? The garden has roses?","feeling":"Surprised","emoji":"🌹","bg":["#fbc2eb","#fda085"],"fg":"#42132b"}
{"text":"Goodness, that's an enormous turtle!","feeling":"Surprised","emoji":"😮","bg":["#c9e8f2","#8fc5d9"],"fg":"#18313b"}
{"text":"Well, bless my socks!","feeling":"Surprised","emoji":"😲","bg":["#f6d58a","#e9b96e"],"fg":"#3b260c"}
{"text":"You came through the rain?","feeling":"Surprised","emoji":"🌧️","bg":["#9bb7c9","#6f8fa8"],"fg":"#102532"}
{"text":"Oh dear, the cupboard moved!","feeling":"Afraid","emoji":"😨","bg":["#c7b8d9","#9d8bb9"],"fg":"#21152e"}
{"text":"My word, what a splendid hat!","feeling":"Happy","emoji":"🎩","bg":["#f5d58a","#d8a84e"],"fg":"#302008"}
{"text":"I never knew Grandpa could juggle!","feeling":"Surprised","emoji":"🤹","bg":["#f3b6a8","#e88782"],"fg":"#3a171b"}
{"text":"What a sight this is!","feeling":"Surprised","emoji":"😯","bg":["#f0c4d8","#d995b8"],"fg":"#35152a"}
{"text":"Good heavens, the baby is walking!","feeling":"Happy","emoji":"🚶","bg":["#f7df91","#eab85d"],"fg":"#382506"}
{"text":"Oh my, you found the treasure!","feeling":"Happy","emoji":"💎","bg":["#9de0d2","#62bcae"],"fg":"#10342f"}
{"text":"You really made all those cookies?","feeling":"Surprised","emoji":"🍪","bg":["#e9c28e","#c98c58"],"fg":"#321b0c"}
{"text":"What? The train is on time?","feeling":"Surprised","emoji":"😲","bg":["#b9e3f5","#78b9df"],"fg":"#102a43"}
{"text":"I can't believe my eyes!","feeling":"Surprised","emoji":"👀","bg":["#d9c2f0","#a98bd1"],"fg":"#241334"}
{"text":"Goodness, the pond is full!","feeling":"Happy","emoji":"💧","bg":["#b8ead8","#72c9b2"],"fg":"#12352f"}
{"text":"Well, I'll be! A talking parrot!","feeling":"Surprised","emoji":"🦜","bg":["#f6d58a","#e9a85d"],"fg":"#382006"}
{"text":"My word, that's a long beard!","feeling":"Surprised","emoji":"😮","bg":["#d8c4ad","#b79878"],"fg":"#2b2119"}
{"text":"You climbed that mountain?","feeling":"Surprised","emoji":"🏔️","bg":["#c7dff2","#91b8d8"],"fg":"#132b3f"}
{"text":"Oh dear, the rooster is loose!","feeling":"Afraid","emoji":"🐓","bg":["#f2b4a8","#db817e"],"fg":"#351414"}
{"text":"What an unexpected treat!","feeling":"Happy","emoji":"🎁","bg":["#f8d477","#f2ae62"],"fg":"#402300"}
{"text":"Good heavens, you've got a medal!","feeling":"Happy","emoji":"🏅","bg":["#f7d98b","#eab55e"],"fg":"#382507"}
{"text":"I never imagined this!","feeling":"Surprised","emoji":"🤯","bg":["#cbb8ed","#a68bd3"],"fg":"#24153d"}
{"text":"Oh my, the moon looks enormous!","feeling":"Surprised","emoji":"🌕","bg":["#26345f","#536aa3"],"fg":"#ffffff"}
{"text":"What? You fixed my radio?","feeling":"Surprised","emoji":"📻","bg":["#f6d365","#fda085"],"fg":"#3a1d00"}
{"text":"Goodness, those are real diamonds!","feeling":"Surprised","emoji":"💎","bg":["#b8f2f0","#6fc8e8"],"fg":"#123047"}
{"text":"You remembered the old song?","feeling":"Surprised","emoji":"🎶","bg":["#d9c2f0","#a88bd0"],"fg":"#27163d"}
{"text":"Well, fancy that, it fits!","feeling":"Happy","emoji":"✨","bg":["#ffe29f","#ffa99f"],"fg":"#4a1f1f"}
{"text":"My word, the snow is pink!","feeling":"Surprised","emoji":"🌸","bg":["#f7c6d9","#e987b5"],"fg":"#42152e"}
{"text":"I can't believe the roses bloomed!","feeling":"Surprised","emoji":"🌹","bg":["#f7b2c4","#e96b83"],"fg":"#461522"}
{"text":"Oh dear, the turkey followed me!","feeling":"Afraid","emoji":"🦃","bg":["#d8b08c","#a8745c"],"fg":"#24150f"}
{"text":"What a remarkable little invention!","feeling":"Happy","emoji":"💡","bg":["#c7f0d8","#76c9a5"],"fg":"#12382d"}
{"text":"Good heavens, you're here before me!","feeling":"Surprised","emoji":"⏰","bg":["#b9d7f5","#789bd1"],"fg":"#102342"}
{"text":"You actually found my button?","feeling":"Surprised","emoji":"😮","bg":["#d9efff","#a8c8f0"],"fg":"#14213d"}
{"text":"What? The cake is still warm?","feeling":"Surprised","emoji":"🍰","bg":["#ffe3b3","#f5b6a5"],"fg":"#48200f"}
{"text":"Goodness, that's your handwriting?","feeling":"Surprised","emoji":"📝","bg":["#e5dcff","#b9a9e8"],"fg":"#21153d"}
{"text":"I never thought we'd see one!","feeling":"Surprised","emoji":"😲","bg":["#d5f5e3","#8fd3b6"],"fg":"#123326"}
{"text":"Oh my, the baby said hello!","feeling":"Happy","emoji":"👶","bg":["#fff0c2","#ffc98b"],"fg":"#402400"}
{"text":"Well, bless me, you're engaged?","feeling":"Surprised","emoji":"💍","bg":["#e9e0ff","#c4b5e8"],"fg":"#24153f"}
{"text":"My word, that was quick!","feeling":"Surprised","emoji":"⚡","bg":["#fff3a6","#ffd166"],"fg":"#3a2900"}
{"text":"You brought the whole family?","feeling":"Surprised","emoji":"😮","bg":["#d8f3f0","#9bd8d0"],"fg":"#123b3a"}
{"text":"What a beautiful unexpected sight!","feeling":"Surprised","emoji":"✨","bg":["#ffe1ed","#f4b6cf"],"fg":"#42152b"}
{"text":"Good heavens, the roof is fixed!","feeling":"Happy","emoji":"🏠","bg":["#d9f0ff","#a7c9e8"],"fg":"#142b43"}
{"text":"I can't believe how fast you are!","feeling":"Happy","emoji":"🚀","bg":["#ffe08a","#ffb36b"],"fg":"#2b1600"}
{"text":"Oh dear, the mailbox is singing!","feeling":"Surprised","emoji":"🎶","bg":["#b8e8e0","#8fc9d8"],"fg":"#102b35"}
{"text":"What? It came from the garden?","feeling":"Surprised","emoji":"😮","bg":["#b9d8ff","#8fb4e8"],"fg":"#10213d"}
{"text":"Goodness, what a surprise to wake up!","feeling":"Surprised","emoji":"🌅","bg":["#ffd59a","#f3a6a6"],"fg":"#35151a"}
{"text":"That bin juice has soaked my shoes. Vile.","feeling":"Disgusted","emoji":"🤢","bg":["#c8c98a","#9fa66d"],"fg":"#20240d"}
{"text":"I opened the fridge and nearly gagged.","feeling":"Disgusted","emoji":"🤮","bg":["#d5c98b","#b0a36f"],"fg":"#241d0b"}
{"text":"Who leaves plates like that? Filthy.","feeling":"Disgusted","emoji":"🧼","bg":["#d7d1b5","#b5ad8b"],"fg":"#242216"}
{"text":"The bus seat was sticky. Absolutely revolting.","feeling":"Disgusted","emoji":"🤢","bg":["#c9b69d","#a68e78"],"fg":"#211810"}
{"text":"I found mould on my afternoon scone.","feeling":"Disgusted","emoji":"🦠","bg":["#b8c58a","#8fa267"],"fg":"#17220e"}
{"text":"That smell in the lift was unbearable.","feeling":"Disgusted","emoji":"🤮","bg":["#c5b79d","#a18c76"],"fg":"#21170f"}
{"text":"Someone spat on the pavement again. Ghastly.","feeling":"Disgusted","emoji":"🤢","bg":["#d8d2a3","#b9b58b"],"fg":"#292617"}
{"text":"The public loo was beyond shameful.","feeling":"Disgusted","emoji":"🤮","bg":["#b8b7a1","#999983"],"fg":"#202018"}
{"text":"I won't eat here after seeing that kitchen.","feeling":"Disgusted","emoji":"🤢","bg":["#c9b98f","#b59d73"],"fg":"#281d12"}
{"text":"There was hair in my tea. I nearly retched.","feeling":"Disgusted","emoji":"🤮","bg":["#d7c79c","#c1ae83"],"fg":"#2b2117"}
{"text":"The dog mess is right outside my gate.","feeling":"Disgusted","emoji":"💩","bg":["#b99b72","#a9825d"],"fg":"#21170f"}
{"text":"That sandwich looked like wet cardboard.","feeling":"Disgusted","emoji":"😖","bg":["#c5b98e","#afa276"],"fg":"#272116"}
{"text":"I wiped the bench and found old grease.","feeling":"Disgusted","emoji":"🤢","bg":["#b7ad79","#9e965f"],"fg":"#211f12"}
{"text":"The casserole tasted like dirty dishwater.","feeling":"Disgusted","emoji":"🤮","bg":["#b8b58a","#999b70"],"fg":"#202313"}
{"text":"I saw a rat behind the supermarket.","feeling":"Disgusted","emoji":"🐀","bg":["#aaa99b","#8e8e83"],"fg":"#1d1d1b"}
{"text":"Those socks have been festering for days.","feeling":"Disgusted","emoji":"🤢","bg":["#aaa878","#8c945f"],"fg":"#1c2413"}
{"text":"The sink is full of congealed fat. Horrid.","feeling":"Disgusted","emoji":"🤢","bg":["#c6d8b8","#a8c49b"],"fg":"#182116"}
{"text":"I lifted the lid and wished I hadn't.","feeling":"Disgusted","emoji":"😖","bg":["#b9c9b0","#91aa88"],"fg":"#182016"}
{"text":"That milk was lumpy. Straight in the bin.","feeling":"Disgusted","emoji":"🤮","bg":["#d5dfad","#b9ca84"],"fg":"#202713"}
{"text":"The changing room floor was disgusting.","feeling":"Disgusted","emoji":"🤢","bg":["#b8c2b0","#929e8b"],"fg":"#171c16"}
{"text":"I can't believe anyone serves food like this.","feeling":"Disgusted","emoji":"😠","bg":["#d8b19c","#c68d7e"],"fg":"#2a1410"}
{"text":"The smell from that drain is monstrous.","feeling":"Disgusted","emoji":"🤮","bg":["#9daf87","#7f956d"],"fg":"#111a0e"}
{"text":"There was something crawling in the salad.","feeling":"Disgusted","emoji":"🐛","bg":["#c5d69d","#a5bd77"],"fg":"#1c2810"}
{"text":"I found a used tissue in my pocket.","feeling":"Disgusted","emoji":"😨","bg":["#c7d0c8","#aab8b0"],"fg":"#17201b"}
{"text":"That mattress should have been burned.","feeling":"Disgusted","emoji":"🔥","bg":["#c9a39a","#af7e78"],"fg":"#281310"}
{"text":"The bin bag leaked all over my slippers.","feeling":"Disgusted","emoji":"🤢","bg":["#b8c9a2","#99b182"],"fg":"#17220f"}
{"text":"I nearly lost my lunch on that train.","feeling":"Disgusted","emoji":"🤢","bg":["#d8e6b8","#b8cf9a"],"fg":"#26351f"}
{"text":"The toilet seat was wet. Enough said.","feeling":"Disgusted","emoji":"🤢","bg":["#cbd8d2","#aebdb4"],"fg":"#202b29"}
{"text":"Someone left half-chewed food on the table.","feeling":"Disgusted","emoji":"🤮","bg":["#d9c4a8","#bea386"],"fg":"#382719"}
{"text":"That fish counter reeked to high heaven.","feeling":"Disgusted","emoji":"🤢","bg":["#b8d0c8","#8fb5aa"],"fg":"#1d332e"}
{"text":"I won't touch another buffet this year.","feeling":"Disgusted","emoji":"🚫","bg":["#d9d5a8","#c1bd86"],"fg":"#343318"}
{"text":"The carpet was damp and smelled rotten.","feeling":"Disgusted","emoji":"🤢","bg":["#b9b2a5","#928b80"],"fg":"#241f1b"}
{"text":"I saw mould creeping across the bread.","feeling":"Disgusted","emoji":"🦠","bg":["#d4d89d","#b8c27c"],"fg":"#293319"}
{"text":"Those bathroom tiles are black with grime.","feeling":"Disgusted","emoji":"🧽","bg":["#7f8b84","#56645e"],"fg":"#ffffff"}
{"text":"The café spoon had dried food on it.","feeling":"Disgusted","emoji":"🤢","bg":["#d6d5c8","#b7b7a8"],"fg":"#292a25"}
{"text":"I had to wash my hands three times.","feeling":"Disgusted","emoji":"🧼","bg":["#c8dce0","#a8c5ca"],"fg":"#203239"}
{"text":"That meat looked grey and slimy.","feeling":"Disgusted","emoji":"🤢","bg":["#b7b58a","#8f9870"],"fg":"#241f16"}
{"text":"The neighbour's rubbish is swarming with flies.","feeling":"Disgusted","emoji":"🪰","bg":["#b8aa72","#8f8658"],"fg":"#211c12"}
{"text":"I opened the cupboard and found droppings.","feeling":"Disgusted","emoji":"💩","bg":["#b8946d","#987653"],"fg":"#24180f"}
{"text":"The smell of that ashtray turned my stomach.","feeling":"Disgusted","emoji":"🤮","bg":["#b7a27d","#927b61"],"fg":"#211a14"}
{"text":"That public bench was covered in muck.","feeling":"Disgusted","emoji":"🤢","bg":["#aaa58b","#858b72"],"fg":"#1d2118"}
{"text":"I stepped in something foul at the post office.","feeling":"Disgusted","emoji":"👟","bg":["#b59b79","#927b61"],"fg":"#241910"}
{"text":"The leftovers had developed their own ecosystem.","feeling":"Disgusted","emoji":"🦠","bg":["#9fae83","#718b6b"],"fg":"#172318"}
{"text":"Someone sneezed all over the cake display.","feeling":"Disgusted","emoji":"🤧","bg":["#c7ad91","#a88776"],"fg":"#281b18"}
{"text":"I couldn't finish breakfast after that sight.","feeling":"Disgusted","emoji":"🤢","bg":["#b4ad7d","#8b9568"],"fg":"#202114"}
{"text":"The lift smelled of wet dog and old beer.","feeling":"Disgusted","emoji":"👃","bg":["#9d927d","#786f65"],"fg":"#181512"}
{"text":"That stain on the pillow is unforgivable.","feeling":"Disgusted","emoji":"🤢","bg":["#d8c3a5","#b79b7a"],"fg":"#24170e"}
{"text":"I threw out the whole loaf after one spot.","feeling":"Disgusted","emoji":"🗑️","bg":["#c8b98a","#a89a6f"],"fg":"#211b0d"}
{"text":"The queue toilet had no soap. Disgraceful.","feeling":"Disgusted","emoji":"🚽","bg":["#b8c4b0","#8fa18b"],"fg":"#172019"}
{"text":"That greasy handle made me wipe my hand.","feeling":"Disgusted","emoji":"🧼","bg":["#c9b58c","#a48f68"],"fg":"#21180d"}
{"text":"The takeaway box was leaking something green.","feeling":"Disgusted","emoji":"🤢","bg":["#b5c58a","#849d62"],"fg":"#17200d"}
{"text":"I saw the chef scratch and keep cooking.","feeling":"Disgusted","emoji":"🤮","bg":["#c4a27d","#a77c5d"],"fg":"#24150d"}
{"text":"The bin was buzzing. I walked straight past.","feeling":"Disgusted","emoji":"🪰","bg":["#b8c1ad","#89977d"],"fg":"#172016"}
{"text":"That soup had a skin on it. Horrible.","feeling":"Disgusted","emoji":"🤢","bg":["#b8a477","#907c55"],"fg":"#21180b"}
{"text":"The communal fridge is a biohazard.","feeling":"Disgusted","emoji":"☣️","bg":["#aab77b","#7f925d"],"fg":"#17200d"}
{"text":"There was a toenail clipping by my chair.","feeling":"Disgusted","emoji":"🤮","bg":["#c6b18b","#a28e6c"],"fg":"#24180d"}
{"text":"I don't care how cheap it is; it's foul.","feeling":"Disgusted","emoji":"🤢","bg":["#b7b58a","#8f8b65"],"fg":"#241f16"}
{"text":"The garden bench was slick with bird muck.","feeling":"Disgusted","emoji":"💩","bg":["#c6b08a","#9c805d"],"fg":"#211a12"}
{"text":"That smell clung to my coat all evening.","feeling":"Disgusted","emoji":"🤧","bg":["#aaa987","#858565"],"fg":"#1f2118"}
