{"text":"That napkin is covered in something brown.","feeling":"Disgusted","emoji":"🤢","bg":["#806247","#624936"],"fg":"#fff8e8"}
{"text":"The pet bowl is full of congealed mush.","feeling":"Disgusted","emoji":"🤢","bg":["#788052","#59623b"],"fg":"#fffbea"}
{"text":"I feel queasy just looking at it.","feeling":"Disgusted","emoji":"🤢","bg":["#6d7b4a","#4f5f38"],"fg":"#fffceb"}
{"text":"Those leftovers smell completely rotten.","feeling":"Disgusted","emoji":"🤮","bg":["#596640","#414d30"],"fg":"#fffbe9"}
{"text":"The seat was warm and sticky. Vile.","feeling":"Disgusted","emoji":"🤢","bg":["#765b43","#5b4434"],"fg":"#fff8e7"}
{"text":"I can't get that taste out of my mouth.","feeling":"Disgusted","emoji":"🤢","bg":["#d8d86a","#a9b84f"],"fg":"#351b24"}
{"text":"The floor is slick with mystery goo.","feeling":"Disgusted","emoji":"🫠","bg":["#9fc96b","#6eaa61"],"fg":"#172b24"}
{"text":"I saw a cockroach and nearly screamed.","feeling":"Afraid","emoji":"😱","bg":["#586b87","#384b68"],"fg":"#fff4df"}
{"text":"That jar is bubbling. Throw it out.","feeling":"Afraid","emoji":"⚠️","bg":["#f2b15b","#df754d"],"fg":"#3a1717"}
{"text":"The smell from your shoes is unbearable.","feeling":"Disgusted","emoji":"🤮","bg":["#c5c878","#a5ad62"],"fg":"#30251c"}
